    "",
    "Hold it and press the keybind to open the &6transmutation&r grid: learn items by placing them in, then spend EMC to duplicate anything you have learned. It also smelts blocks in your hand, crafts fuels, and powers most PE recipes.",
    "",
    "Craft it from glowstone dust, redstone, and diamonds. This entry quest gates the rest of the chapter — work through the dependency lines to climb from fuels to collectors, condensers, and matter-tier gear.",
